==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Stormfront|Dusclops|35}} from the {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansion.
*'''Psypunch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Hypno|9}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

